{"unit_id":"jmxsxwyzjdwl__dsh-mmroute#card-zh","repo":"jmxsxwyzjdwl/dsh-mmroute","commit":"799e17bcbf2ea417e49dc36aa7a41cf889353d34","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mmroute 是面向 DSH 网页端的多模态图片路由插件。它拦截模型流中的图片请求，并按模型标记或适配器能力决定直发或先转述。纯文本模型可接收理解模型生成的图片文字；图片类错误还能触发路由重试。插件提供设置面板，可选择理解模型、标记模型模态，并支持 vision_relook 聚焦复看及转述缓存。适合希望让文本模型处理截图、图片或工具生成图像的 DSH 用户；需在 DSH 中配置可用的多模态模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:710-756","lib/index.js:758-797","lib/index.js:815-851","lib/client.js:242-252"]}
{"unit_id":"jmxsxwyzjdwl__dsh-mmroute#card-en","repo":"jmxsxwyzjdwl/dsh-mmroute","commit":"799e17bcbf2ea417e49dc36aa7a41cf889353d34","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-mmroute routes images for the DSH web client. It transcribes images for text-only models using a configured vision model, and image errors can trigger retries. Its settings panel selects models and modalities; vision_relook supports focused image checks. Configure a multimodal model in DSH.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:710-756","lib/index.js:758-797","lib/index.js:815-851","lib/client.js:242-252"]}
{"unit_id":"jmxsxwyzjdwl__dsh-mmroute#intent-1","repo":"jmxsxwyzjdwl/dsh-mmroute","commit":"799e17bcbf2ea417e49dc36aa7a41cf889353d34","type":"intent","lang":"zh","text":"想让只能处理文字的模型也能回答图片问题。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:710-756"]}
