{"unit_id":"jmxsxwyzjdwl__dsh-mmroute#feature-1","repo":"jmxsxwyzjdwl/dsh-mmroute","commit":"799e17bcbf2ea417e49dc36aa7a41cf889353d34","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mmroute 的功能「图片转述」：图片进入纯文本路由时，插件调用配置的多模态理解模型生成描述，再把描述写入请求供文本模型回答。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:710-756"]}
{"unit_id":"jmxsxwyzjdwl__dsh-mmroute#feature-2","repo":"jmxsxwyzjdwl/dsh-mmroute","commit":"799e17bcbf2ea417e49dc36aa7a41cf889353d34","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mmroute 的功能「模态路由」：插件根据模型标记和适配器声明判断图片应原样发送，还是转为文字后交给纯文本模型处理。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:710-718"]}
{"unit_id":"jmxsxwyzjdwl__dsh-mmroute#feature-3","repo":"jmxsxwyzjdwl/dsh-mmroute","commit":"799e17bcbf2ea417e49dc36aa7a41cf889353d34","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mmroute 的功能「失败后重试」：检测到含图请求的图片类错误时，插件临时切换该模型路由到转述路径，并请求 agent loop 重试。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:758-797"]}
{"unit_id":"jmxsxwyzjdwl__dsh-mmroute#feature-4","repo":"jmxsxwyzjdwl/dsh-mmroute","commit":"799e17bcbf2ea417e49dc36aa7a41cf889353d34","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mmroute 的功能「聚焦复看」：作答模型可通过 vision_relook 指定附件和问题，让理解模型针对图片细节再次核查并回答。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:815-851"]}
{"unit_id":"jmxsxwyzjdwl__dsh-mmroute#caveat-1","repo":"jmxsxwyzjdwl/dsh-mmroute","commit":"799e17bcbf2ea417e49dc36aa7a41cf889353d34","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mmroute 会把待处理图片交给配置的理解模型生成转述，服务由用户在 DSH 模型配置中选择。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:512-530"]}
{"unit_id":"jmxsxwyzjdwl__dsh-mmroute#caveat-2","repo":"jmxsxwyzjdwl/dsh-mmroute","commit":"799e17bcbf2ea417e49dc36aa7a41cf889353d34","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mmroute 将状态和转述缓存保存在 DSH_HOME 下的 mmroute.json；未设置时使用 ~/.dsh/mmroute.json。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:62-64","lib/index.js:128-129"]}
